  - m_Id: 45723128950784
    m_Localized: Planetary Upgrades
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47180699922432
    m_Localized: 'Starting Population: {0}

      Surviving Population: {1}

      Energy
      Collected: {2}

      Energy Required to Advance: {3}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47947540328448
    m_Localized: "We emerged victorious from all the various wars and cataclysms.
      \nFrom a simple cell to a mighty civilization, uniting the entire planet in
      peace. \nNo single ruler, no tyrant, just a commonwealth of the people. \nUnfortunately,
      we are being chased by a wild bunch of angry motherships. \nThey mean business!\nWe
      jumped into an intergalactic wormhole (as you do) to avoid them.\n\nWe have
      to gather enough energy balls to emerge from this wormhole and advance to the
      next stage. \n\n---------\n\n'Fun' fact:\nThe Kardashev Scale is a system for
      measuring how advanced your galactic civilization is!\nYour civilization triez
      to achieve Type I, which means it's trying to utilize the resources of the
      planet.\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51488510177280
    m_Localized: 'Again, we managed to survive, but don''t celebrate yet!

      We
      managed to exploit the whole planet''s energy.

      So now we have to find
      a way to fully gather the energy of our SunStar.

      We have our top men
      working on it.


      But meanwhile it seems the motherships cried to their
      mommy.

      We have to defeat this new, formidable boss...


      ---------


      Type
      II in the Kardashev scale means that the civilization managed to

      fully
      exploit the energy of their stellar system''s star.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51544466386944
    m_Localized: 'No one can stop us! Now that we have defeated that Bad Mothershipper

      we
      are on the way to conquering the whole galaxy and gathering it''s energy.

      Our
      scientists already found a way to jump from four to five dimensions using that
      energy.

      You know what this means? Bagels!

      So there is absolutely
      no one who could stop... Wait, what''s that?

      Is it some kind of small
      moon? That''s no moon, that''s a rogue planet, and an angry one!

      So
      you know the drill, gather energy, defeat the Ultimate Enemy so we can

      finally
      push the whopper button!


      ---------


      Type III in the Kardashev
      scale means that the civilization managed to

      fully exploit the energy
      of the whole galaxy. That''s a lot of energy!

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52693919592448
    m_Localized: Completed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52851600257024
    m_Localized: Not Completed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57955783012352
    m_Localized: 'Current Energy: {0}GW

      Current Population: {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61010880491520
    m_Localized: "A ring of detectors that find the energy exhausted from the space
      pipes.\n\nThe energy can be of different quantum levels: white gives 1GW, yellow
      10GW, red 100GW and blue 1000GW.\nThe higher the gate number, the bigger the
      chance for a high level energy particle, \ngiving more energy.\n\nThis upgrade
      makes the pipes spit out more energy particles of random levels.\n\nCurrent
      gate energy particles: {0}\nNext gate energy particles: {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61677657387008
    m_Localized: O-Ring
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64160177844224
    m_Localized: "Detects the energy particles that are radiated from that big, gaping
      black hole at the top.\nThe higher the level, the more energy particles are
      observed to eject.\nThe higher the gate number, the bigger the chance for a
      high level energy particle, \ngiving more energy.\n\nBlack hole has bigger
      chance for high level energy!\n\nCurrent black hole energy particles: {0}\nNext
      black hole energy particles: {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64025406468096
    m_Localized: Accretio-Sucction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64548515868672
    m_Localized: "Detects the energy particles that are radiated from our SunStar
      at the bottom.\nThe higher level, the more energy particles are observed to
      eject.\nThe higher the gate number, the bigger the chance for a high level
      energy particle, \ngiving more energy.\n\nSunStar has bigger chance for high
      level energy!\n\nCurrent SunStar energy particles: {0}\nNext SunStar energy
      particles: {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64571504848896
    m_Localized: 'Allows building artificial antropomorphic droids, that are totally
      not humans. They have no feelings.

      They don''t mind being used as a
      free workforce, the scientists think. No matter what the androids keep saying.

      This
      produces an amount of additional population every second.

      One would
      argue that this is totally not even immoral.


      Current additional population
      per second: {0}

      Next additional population per second: {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64570527576064
    m_Localized: Android Slavery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65013186031616
    m_Localized: "Spend energy for extraction of a blue space spice from the planet
      V-yag'ra.\nIt allows the population to be more... energetic. \nYes, it works
      on androids too!\n\nThis upgrade generates additional percentage of population
      every second.\nIf you know what 'Compound Interest' is, or watched Spiffing
      Brit, then you understand what this means...\nSo, red pill or blue pill?\n\nCurrent
      additional percentage of population per second: {0}\nNext additional percentage
      of population per second: {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65803892027392
    m_Localized: 'This instantly and permanently increases the base population by
      a given number.

      Just add water and stir! Yummy!


      Current base
      population: {0}

      Next base population: {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65803007029248
    m_Localized: Instant Population
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65012477194240
    m_Localized: V-Yag'ra Energizing Therapy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 66369527476224
    m_Localized: 'Energy Shield has two modes:

      Active - when there are enemies
      in it''s radius and press jump

      the shield can damage them or even ''parry''
      if close enough - dealing a lot of damage!

      Passive - reduces damage
      on collision.


      Also absorbs black hole and SunStar damage.

      Does
      not protect from spin damage tho...


      Regenerated with energy.


      Current
      max population damage absorbed: {0}

      Next max population damage absorbed:
      {1}

      Current shield radius: {2}

      Next shield radius: {3}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 66368713781248
    m_Localized: Energy Shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 66606413377536
    m_Localized: 'Thrusters distributed around the planet, that reduce planetary
      spin up to 0RPM.

      The thrusters do kill a marginal number of people living
      next to them, and endangered species,

      but the rest of us can enjoy not
      being ejected into the void of space.


      Regenerated with energy.


      Current
      max RPM reduced: {0}

      Next max RPM reduced: {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 66605591293952
    m_Localized: Spin Doctor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 66865961103360
    m_Localized: Toorbo Boost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 66866703495168
    m_Localized: 'Thrusters distributed at the poles that allow to speed up if the
      planet lags too much.

      Allows to avoid a premature ejection from the
      wormhole.

      Each level adds additional seconds of speed up.

      The
      planet will speed up only until it reaches the initial position.


      Regenerated
      with energy.


      Current max boost usage time: {0}

      Next max boost
      usage time: {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
