  - m_Id: 431285975379968
    m_Localized: Irritating Motherships Attack!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 431651076960256
    m_Localized: Win Accomplished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 436066827628544
    m_Localized: Irritating Motherships
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5574157536063488
    m_Localized: Motherships' Mom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5574446511026176
    m_Localized: Ultimate Enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5575115317964800
    m_Localized: Motherships' Mom came to complain!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15712873009115136
    m_Localized: You meet your Ultimate Enemy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20369774816784384
    m_Localized: Don't reset
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20369858182770688
    m_Localized: Reset
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20369948142202880
    m_Localized: Are you sure?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20370038437179392
    m_Localized: 'This will REMOVE your whole game progress and  start from scratch!

      This
      can NOT be undone!

      Are you sure?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32108316106420224
    m_Localized: "It turned out that humanity\u2019s ultimate enemy was humanity
      all along! Who would\u2019ve thunk it? What a plot twist!\n\nOur future selves
      managed to gather the energy of the entire galaxy and used it to ascend to
      the fifth dimension. Then they felt threatened by us, so they sent UFOs, the
      MotherShipper, and finally tried to deal with us themselves.\n\nBut we managed
      to defeat them. Now, what we have to do is make sure we don\u2019t make the
      same mistakes. We will gather the energy of the entire galaxy and use it for
      good and peace! Our best astrophysicist, Mike \u201CdeGrasso\u201D Tyson, is
      already working on his \u201CTyson Sphere.\u201D\n\nOf course, we have to make
      sure our past selves don\u2019t become a threat to us. Gotta remember to send
      some spaceships disguised as UFOs back in time to slow them down...\n\nIn the
      meantime, you can use this level to boldly go to a space gate where no player
      has gone before! The gate you reach on this level will be added to the high
      scores list!\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32116077678555136
    m_Localized: '2026 by Piotr Kaczmarski

      Thank You For Playing!

      Please,
      help build the Potato Community on Discord, Twitch or YouTube!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
